No warranty
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

As stated in both licenses, the software is provided as is, without any
warranty or condition, and the licensor is not liable for any damages.

This matters more than usual here. This software orchestrates laboratory
equipment. Nothing in it has been validated for safety, for clinical use, or
for use with hazardous materials, and no run it produces is evidence of
biological efficacy. Anyone connecting it to physical instruments is
responsible for their own risk assessment, interlocks and institutional
approvals.
